### Login as demo lecturer (only after dev seed)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"lecturer@aives.local","password":"Demo@123456"}

### Copy JWT from login response manually (JetBrains HTTP Client variables)
@token = PASTE_JWT_HERE
@courseId = 20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@rubricId = 50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### List questions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses/{{courseId}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create manual question
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"courseId":"{{courseId}}","rubricId":"{{rubricId}}","content":"RESTful API có những ràng buộc nào?","referenceAnswer":"Client-server, stateless, cacheable...","bloomLevel":"UNDERSTAND","difficulty":"MEDIUM"}

### Create exam
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"courseId":"{{courseId}}","title":"Thi vấn đáp SWD392","mainQuestionCount":2,"maxFollowupsPerQuestion":1}
